/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T15:44:29Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T15:45:23Z","body":"> Alllright, delaying the inevitable complaints that \"there's no way to remove the Godot versions from the export template godot version list!!!11!\". Fine.\r\n\r\nTo get rid of a version in the list entirely, you need to delete its containing folder like `4.3.stable` in the OS file manager (deleting the lingering `version.txt` doesn't suffice). You'll also need to restart the editor, as the version will remain listed until you restart the editor (and an error is printed when you select it in the list).\r\n\r\nThis should probably be fixed before 4.7.stable's release too, but it can be done in a follow-up PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274026105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274215322","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118710#issuecomment-4274215322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118710","id":4274215322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-w1ma","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T17:26:02Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T17:26:02Z","body":"I missed the fact that removing the templates via this new button wouldn't remove the entry on the left side.\r\n\r\nIMO this needs to be addressed and thus probably requires a different solution.\r\n\r\nThe fact that only the current editor's version can download templates also tells me that it's weird that this version shares the same interface as other installed version.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274215322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274292131","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118710#issuecomment-4274292131","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118710","id":4274292131,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-xIWj","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T18:12:35Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T18:12:35Z","body":"The list on the left displays any folder in the versions directory, so to remove entries, the editor would need to delete the whole directory. I can make it either ignore folders without recognized templates (so you will have leftovers not visible in the editor, which is _supposedly_ fine, based on the [chat discussion](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/usability/thread/wfeRSsLDhPQpumuko)), or implement the 3-dots menu mentioned above.\r\n\r\n> B - keep the button enabled but make the popup a three-option popup: cancel, delete templates, delete templates & folder\r\n\r\nWhat is cancel supposed to do?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274292131/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274375881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118710#issuecomment-4274375881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118710","id":4274375881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-xczJ","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T19:03:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T19:03:39Z","body":"yeah sorry, i wasn’t clear. i imagined the exact design as there is now, except when you press the trash icon you get a popup asking whether you want to cancel deleting anything, only delete the templates, or delete templates & the folder.\r\n\r\nhowever, i can also imagine the following design: we don’t care about whether there is a folder there or not to show the godot versions; we only show godot versions if there is both a folder and a recognized export template. that way, a “delete all templates” will also remove the godot version from the list, and we don’t need a popup with three options. and we simple leave the empty template folders or template folders with unrecognized files alone. supposedly, if people mess with the templates in those folders, they know what they are doing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274375881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274421566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118710#issuecomment-4274421566","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118710","id":4274421566,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-xn8-","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T19:32:28Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T19:32:28Z","body":"> and we simple leave the empty template folders or template folders with unrecognized files alone. supposedly, if people mess with the templates in those folders, they know what they are doing.\r\n\r\nThe problem is that the folders might contain valid files that are no longer recognized, like `version.txt` (which no longer gets  downloaded) or `android_sources.zip` (which apparently changed name).\r\n\r\nOn the other hand xd\r\nThe Delete All button is getting disabled when the template list is empty, so after you delete templates, you won't be able to delete the directory.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274421566/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274433818","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118710#issuecomment-4274433818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118710","id":4274433818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-xq8a","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T19:39:58Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T19:39:58Z","body":"I think it's fair and probably necessary to cover a special case like a `android_sources.zip`, to recognize that particular file so it _can_ be deleted through the Delete All button. So to summarize, files that get recognized are: current and previously valid template files, a.k.a.  everything that users could have downloaded using the existing 'download templates' functionality. As long as those are there, the Delete All button works, and ideally there's even an item in the Installed Templates tree showing the file (with a delete button).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274433818/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274469896","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118710#issuecomment-4274469896","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118710","id":4274469896,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-xzwI","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T20:03:50Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T20:03:50Z","body":"Ok false alarm, android sources was not renamed. I think I renamed it myself when testing something and had a leftover.\r\nLeaving out `version.txt` is fine.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274469896/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274547133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118710#issuecomment-4274547133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118710","id":4274547133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-yGm9","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T20:54:21Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T20:54:21Z","body":"Removing all template files now permanently removes the entry from the list. What exactly happens to the files is not user's concern 😌","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274547133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274551862","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118710#issuecomment-4274551862","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118710","id":4274551862,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-yHw2","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T20:57:52Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T20:59:19Z","body":"> Removing all template files now permanently removes the entry from the list. What exactly happens to the files is not user's concern 😌\r\n\r\nIdeally if we can, we should remove the `version.txt` and the folder if we find that we're removing the last templates. Previous versions of Godot would recognized the templates as installed just from the presence of the folder, so it would be better not to leave leftovers.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, we could have a delete icon on the `